  - 결과: `35 passed`
- [MANDATORY] `py_compile`:
  - `python3 -m py_compile tools/figma-section-spec.py tools/figma-validate.py tests/unit/test_component_id_extract.py tests/unit/test_vector_path_geometry.py tests/unit/test_asset_manifest_generation.py tests/unit/test_validate_asset_manifest_exists.py tests/unit/test_validate_image.py`
